  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Stop Human Wildlife Conflict in Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Human population and settlements in Mutoko rural district of Zimbabwe are rapidly expanding and encroaching on wildlife habitat leading to people coming into contact with dangerous wild animals such as hyenas. Over 60 cases of livestock attacked by hyenas have been reported in various parts of the district and some villagers are now resorting to retaliatory killing of the wild animals which is unlawful and dangerous.</narrative>
  </description>
